#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:5 f8e53117713e4b2db9d3384ce95caaa2
msgid "AIS (for boats)"
msgstr "AIS（船舶应用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:9 2df0c5e1d9ba4f3da23139c69a09272d
msgid ""
"Rover supports `Automatic identification system (AIS) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automatic_identification_system>`__ sensors "
"allowing the position of manned boats to be displayed on the ground station"
msgstr ""
"Rover 支持 "
"`自动识别系统（AIS）<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automatic_identification_system>`__"
" 传感器，可在地面站上显示有人驾驶船只的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:11 a17c30cf994c4d8e98b2bab3ee4cc440
msgid ""
"Support for this peripheral is also available for Planes and Copters using "
"the `Custom Firwmare Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ , by "
"creating a firmware build including this feature listed under the IDENT "
"category."
msgstr ""
"通过 `自定义固件构建服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 为固定翼和多旋翼创建包含该功能的固件（在 IDENT"
" 类别下选择），也可支持此外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:14 a1651333d0a047a08f7bc0abf5c745a9
msgid "What to Buy"
msgstr "推荐产品"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:16 c4156ff9a4ef4672879722d8150026e3
msgid ""
"`dAISy 2+ <https://shop.wegmatt.com/products/daisy-2-dual-channel-ais-"
"receiver-with-nmea-0183>`__"
msgstr ""
"`dAISy 2+ <https://shop.wegmatt.com/products/daisy-2-dual-channel-ais-"
"receiver-with-nmea-0183>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:17 4299cd402ceb4913b558739e3edc5c9c
msgid ""
"AIS compatible antenna (161.975 MHz and 162.025 MHz).  VHF antennas "
"`including this one "
"<https://www.ebay.co.uk/itm/133825338570?chn=ps&norover=1&mkevt=1&mkrid=710-134428-41853-0&mkcid=2&itemid=133825338570&targetid=1279076611409&device=c&mktype=pla&googleloc=9045387&poi=&campaignid=12125450855&mkgroupid=123088734215&rlsatarget=pla-1279076611409&abcId=9300480&merchantid=7309454&gclid=CjwKCAjwmK6IBhBqEiwAocMc8sJIbv4ZN9fhjX3vB1uKhBodpDi0X3O4bFbGwYcejBn_U2bl1SpqfRoCG3EQAvD_BwE>`__"
" should work"
msgstr ""
"兼容 AIS 的天线（161.975 MHz 和 162.025 MHz）。VHF 天线（`包括此款 "
"<https://www.ebay.co.uk/itm/133825338570?chn=ps&norover=1&mkevt=1&mkrid=710-134428-41853-0&mkcid=2&itemid=133825338570&targetid=1279076611409&device=c&mktype=pla&googleloc=9045387&poi=&campaignid=12125450855&mkgroupid=123088734215&rlsatarget=pla-1279076611409&abcId=9300480&merchantid=7309454&gclid=CjwKCAjwmK6IBhBqEiwAocMc8sJIbv4ZN9fhjX3vB1uKhBodpDi0X3O4bFbGwYcejBn_U2bl1SpqfRoCG3EQAvD_BwE>`__）应可使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:20 3ec947e065174f44bd417d4a1c4b5f55
msgid "AutoPilot connection"
msgstr "飞控连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:22 618617c904454e5b98f4709e6e48ee37
msgid ""
"The dAISy2 should be connected to one of the autopilot's serial ports as "
"shown below"
msgstr "dAISy2 应如下图所示连接到飞控的某个串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:29 af270353b21549e8b951f238a400665a
msgid "Autopilot Configuration"
msgstr "飞控配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:31 d2de485c07f64a919d7939862a05cffc
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set these parameters and "
"then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "使用地面站连接飞控，设置以下参数后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:33 e555988a67ee4d528de39f2f4960f4bd
msgid ":ref:`AIS_TYPE <AIS_TYPE>` = 1 (NMEA AIVDM message)"
msgstr ":ref:`AIS_TYPE <AIS_TYPE>` = 1（NMEA AIVDM 消息）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:34 90f5d0b063d24e9ba12125025b65032c
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 40 (AIS) if the sensor is "
"connected to serial port 1.  If another serial port is used please set the "
"appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 40（AIS），如果传感器连接到串口 "
"1。如使用其他串口，请设置相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:35 34d565ca87614976918ebde0d0b15499
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 38 (38400 bps) if using serial port 1."
"  If another serial port is used please set the appropriate SERIALx_BAUD "
"parameter instead"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 38（38400 bps），如使用串口 1。如使用其他串口，请设置相应的 "
"SERIALx_BAUD 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:36 6541ed124a7c4ce3a446bce17596cd2c
msgid ""
":ref:`MAV1_ADSB <MAV1_ADSB>` = 5 to enable sending AIS mavlink messages to "
"the ground station over Serial0 (the USB port).  If a telemetry radio is "
"used the ``MAVx_ADSB`` param corresponding to its stream should also be set "
"to 5(Hz).(Streams are numbered from first in order of Serial ports "
"configured for MAVLink, MAV1 the first, MAV2 the second, etc.)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAV1_ADSB <MAV1_ADSB>` = 5，通过 Serial0（USB 端口）向地面站发送 AIS MAVLink "
"消息。如果使用数传电台，其对应流的 `MAVx_ADSB` 参数也应设置为 5（Hz）。（流按 Serial 端口配置为 MAVLink "
"的顺序编号，MAV1 为第一个，MAV2 为第二个，以此类推）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:39 189093a873684597a4485ff78329eea0
msgid "dAISy2 Configuration and Testing"
msgstr "dAISy2 配置与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:41 fbf98b66c1024a30995c038d55e5a6a2
msgid "Connect dAISy2 to your PC using a USB cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线将 dAISy2 连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:42 1fa93fee16284ebd8cf0f8be3c8e0e44
msgid ""
"Download, install and run a terminal program such as `Putty "
"<https://www.putty.org/>`__"
msgstr "下载、安装并运行终端程序，例如 `Putty <https://www.putty.org/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:43 324231c673d7440d9f47ec38cee57386
msgid ""
"Connect to the dAISy2's COM port at 38400 baud and press <ESC> to view the "
"setup menu"
msgstr "以 38400 波特连接 dAISy2 的 COM 端口，按 <ESC> 查看设置菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:44 2398f144486849f6a9b0c1afff8f099b
msgid ""
"Type \"3\" to enable the serial port.  \"38400 8N1 serial output (NMEA HS w/"
" adapter)\" should be displayed"
msgstr "输入 `3` 启用串口，应显示 `38400 8N1 serial output (NMEA HS w/ adapter)`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:45 78ff7c0c2c374bdc96924caa0f247189
msgid "Type \"#\" to save this change and retain this baudrate on boot"
msgstr "输入 `#` 保存更改，并在启动时保留该波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:46 661277812aea4834a9687a887c598b4c
msgid ""
"Type \"T\" to enable entering a test NMEA message and then copy-paste this "
"message, \"!AIVDM,1,1,,A,3815;hUw00wfUdHMPfQ4s8WT0D`r,0*00\", or hit "
"\"Enter\" and use the default location"
msgstr ""
"输入 `T` 启用输入测试 NMEA "
"消息，然后复制粘贴此消息：`!AIVDM,1,1,,A,3815;hUw00wfUdHMPfQ4s8WT0D\\`r,0*00`，或直接按回车键使用默认位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:52 d806c1d0622a4b67b4ce74e9b642e267
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with Mission Planner (or another ground station) "
"and a boat should appear on the South West coast of England"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner（或其他地面站）连接飞控，英国西南海岸应显示一艘船"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:58 330d580995294253bfc3d40c92a8e6c2
msgid "press <ESC> to stop sending test messages"
msgstr "按 <ESC> 停止发送测试消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:61 c81a0d0ae55d400095a4f91acc76cd25
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:63 d9346c526ad1413aafc8b03fc5c52fae
msgid ""
"The AIS_OPTIONS parameter specifies which AIS messages are logged.  These "
"messages are useful for debugging purposes and contain the following "
"information"
msgstr "AIS_OPTIONS 参数指定记录哪些 AIS 消息。这些消息用于调试，包含以下信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:65 b7d7eb1daae94fb683d017043ed3ea34
msgid "TimeUS : System time that the AIS message was received"
msgstr "TimeUS：接收 AIS 消息时的系统时间"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:66 ae35756853e8489b8d28f394944b266d
msgid "Num : Number of fragments in the currently accumulating message"
msgstr "Num：当前累积消息中的分片总数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:67 f70c880ea9514722962dcfe1fa904b3a
msgid "Total : Fragment number of this sentence"
msgstr "Total：本句的分片编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:68 bdfbbad000ee45eda350c46608397db5
msgid "ID : Sequential message ID for multi-sentence messages"
msgstr "ID：多句消息的顺序消息 ID"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:69 597c1d041cb442a7aae407749e6357c4
msgid "Payload : Data payload"
msgstr "Payload：数据载荷"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ais.rst:72 67006c02416242f68ecbaa12b60e0ad2
msgid "User Videos"
msgstr "用户视频"
